Key ships these citation styles and locales from the Citation Style Language project as
separate data files beside the app (Key.app/Contents/Resources/citation). They are not
part of Key's code, are not covered by Key's MIT licence, keep their own licence and are
shipped unmodified. Key reads them at run time; none is compiled into the program.

styles/*.csl
  From https://github.com/citation-style-language/styles
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Each file names its authors and
  contributors in its <info> block.

locales/locales-*.xml
  From https://github.com/citation-style-language/locales
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). Each file names its translators in
  its <info> block.

index.json is generated by Key from the files above (each style's id, title, format and
fields, and the locale codes) so the style list opens without reading every file.
